{"id":"sh/ehcnm9wf","kind":"textbox","name":"Title 1","position":{"left":88,"top":38.33,"width":1104,"height":139.17},"text":"Complete plan - Handover and review","style":{"fontSize":58.67,"typeface":"Aptos Display","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}},
{"id":"sh/zilofed0","kind":"textbox","name":"block-1-label","position":{"left":88,"top":190,"width":1104,"height":36},"text":"Execution pack | Transformation lead","style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#C00000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/onepsjeh","kind":"textbox","name":"block-1-text","position":{"left":88,"top":230,"width":1104,"height":113},"text":"Deliver the value-stream map, squad charter, backlog/WIP policy, CI configuration, test ownership, database migration rules, release/restore runbooks, dashboard and experiment log. Each document has an owner.","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/9on6lov2","kind":"textbox","name":"block-2-label","position":{"left":88,"top":347,"width":1104,"height":36},"text":"Week 12 review | CEO + all department leads","style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#C00000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/mlc7q9wb","kind":"textbox","name":"block-2-text","position":{"left":88,"top":387,"width":1104,"height":113},"text":"Compare pilot outcomes with the recorded baseline; show sample sizes and unresolved risks. Check that another team can execute a release and reuse a documented lesson. Decide to scale, adjust or extend the pilot.","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/nm5ojedw","kind":"textbox","name":"block-3-label","position":{"left":88,"top":504,"width":1104,"height":36},"text":"Main risks and responses","style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#C00000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/4ra5gzed","kind":"textbox","name":"block-3-text","position":{"left":88,"top":544,"width":1104,"height":113},"text":"Feature capacity falls: Sales reprioritizes. Database coupling persists: retain compatibility checks. Trust is weak: leaders change incentives and review behavior. Results are inconclusive: collect more evidence before broader rollout.","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/5sj694vi","kind":"textbox","name":"page-number","position":{"left":1165,"top":693,"width":38,"height":22},"text":"18","style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#7F7F7F","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0}
